# The build context is the repository root (apps/admin/Dockerfile, apps/api/Dockerfile). Nothing
# below is needed to build an image, and some of it must never be inside one.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.github
docs
tools/project-graph/output
# Secrets and local state: never in an image or its build cache.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
